  "description": "Add-on IFileExtractor for Scrubkit that reads .eml (MIME email) files: the From/To/Cc/Subject/Date headers become metadata and the message body becomes text. Handles multipart messages, base64 and quoted-printable encodings, common charsets, and RFC 2047 encoded-word headers — fully offline with no dependencies beyond Scrubkit.Abstractions. Register it via ReadOptions.Extractors.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
